export type M77ContinuationDependencies={fetch?:typeof fetch;load?:()=>Promise<string|null>;append?:(line:string,exclusive:boolean)=>Promise<void>;loadOriginal?:()=>Promise<string>;loadPrevious?:()=>Promise<string>;legacy?:typeof runM72Journey}
export type M77ContinuationResult={status:'passed'|'failed';mode:Mode;stage:string;applicationPostRequests:number;allCreatedAuthSessionsClosed:boolean;requestCount:number;lastStatus:number|null;errorCategory:string|null;receiptSha256:string|null}
const check=continuationCheck,hash=continuationHash,same=continuationSame,core=continuationCore
export function parseM77ContinuationInput(v:unknown):M77ContinuationInput{const x=v as any;check(['diagnostic','baseline','exercise','revisit'].includes(x?.mode)&&same(x.failedM77,M77_FAILED_PIN));return {...parseM77JourneyInput({...x,mode:'baseline'}),mode:x.mode,failedM77:M77_FAILED_PIN}}
export function readM77Continuation(text:string|null,company:string){if(text===null)return [];check(text.length<=96_000_000&&text.endsWith('\n'));let prior:string|null=null;const es=text.trimEnd().split('\n').map((line,i)=>{const e=JSON.parse(line),{sha256,...body}=e;check(e.sequence===i+1&&e.previousSha256===prior&&e.profile===PROFILE&&e.workspaceId===company&&['baseline','exercise','revisit'].includes(e.mode)&&new Date(e.createdAt).toISOString()===e.createdAt&&hash(canonical(body))===sha256);prior=sha256;return e});cleanM77Journal(es);check(es[0]?.kind==='continuation_provenance'&&same(es[0].data.failedM77,M77_FAILED_PIN)&&es[0].data.originalStatus==='failed'&&es[0].data.failedPostRequests===33&&es.filter(e=>e.kind==='continuation_provenance').length===1);for(const e of es)check(['continuation_provenance','attempt_started','baseline','post_intent','post_outcome','exercise_complete','revisit_verified','attempt_finished'].includes(e.kind));check(es.filter(e=>e.kind==='baseline').length===1&&es.filter(e=>e.kind==='exercise_complete').length<=1);const posts=es.filter(e=>e.kind==='post_intent'),complete=es.find(e=>e.kind==='exercise_complete');check(posts.length===(complete?3:0));if(complete){const baseline=es.find(e=>e.kind==='baseline'),id=baseline.data.registers.fugitive.population.versions.at(-1).streamId,base='/workspace-api/workspace/'+company+'/fugitive-population/'+id;for(const [i,name]of ['m77_continuation_population_final','m77_continuation_population_final_review','m77_continuation_population_final_report'].entries())check(posts[i].data.name===name&&posts[i].data.route===base+'/'+['versions','reviews','reports'][i]&&posts[i].data.role===(i===1?'manager2':'manager1')&&posts[i].data.expected===201)}return es}
export function validateM77ContinuationRoute(url:string,method:string,company:string,mode:Mode,allowed:string[]=[]){validateM77JourneyRoute(url,method,company);if(method==='POST'&&url.startsWith(HOST))check(mode==='exercise'&&allowed.includes(url.slice(HOST.length)))}
export async function runM77Continuation(input:M77ContinuationInput,deps:M77ContinuationDependencies={}):Promise<M77ContinuationResult>{
 const company=input.roster.workspaceId,root='/workspace-api/workspace/'+company,es:any[]=[],tokens=new Map<Role,string>(),transport=deps.fetch??globalThis.fetch;let stage='journal_preconditions',attempt:number|null=null,writes=0,closed=true,legacyClosed=true,unknownSessions=0,failed=false,requestCount=0,lastStatus:number|null=null,failureStatus:number|null=null,errorCategory:string|null=null;const allowedPosts=new Set<string>();
 const network=async(url:string,init:RequestInit={})=>{validateM77ContinuationRoute(url,init.method??'GET',company,input.mode,[...allowedPosts]);requestCount++;try{const response=await transport(url,{...init,redirect:'error',signal:AbortSignal.timeout(30000)});lastStatus=response.status;if(response.status>=400)errorCategory='http_status';return response}catch(e){errorCategory=(e as any)?.name==='TimeoutError'?'request_timeout':(e as any)?.name==='AbortError'?'request_aborted':'transport';throw e}};
 const append=async(kind:string,data:any)=>{check(input.mode!=='diagnostic');const body={sequence:es.length+1,previousSha256:es.at(-1)?.sha256??null,profile:PROFILE,workspaceId:company,mode:input.mode,kind,data,createdAt:new Date().toISOString()},e={...body,sha256:hash(canonical(body))},line=JSON.stringify(e)+'\n';await(deps.append??(async(line,exclusive)=>{const f=await open(JOURNAL,exclusive?'wx':'a',0o600);try{await f.writeFile(line);await f.sync()}finally{await f.close()}}))(line,es.length===0);es.push(e)};
 const bytes=async(route:string,role:Role='manager1')=>{stage='authorized_read:'+route.slice(root.length);const r=await network(HOST+route,{headers:{origin:HOST,...(tokens.has(role)?{authorization:'Bearer '+tokens.get(role)}:{})}}),b=new Uint8Array(await r.arrayBuffer());check(r.status===200&&r.headers.get('cache-control')?.includes('no-store')&&b.length<=10_000_000);return new TextDecoder('utf-8',{fatal:true}).decode(b)};
 const get=async(route:string,role:Role='manager1')=>parseM77Json(await bytes(route,role),10_000_000);
 const read=async()=>{const result:any={};for(const[family,base,decode]of [['corporate','corporate-inventories',decodeCorporateRegister],['gas','stationary-natural-gas',decodeGasRegister],['mobile','mobile-diesel',decodeMobileRegister],['fleet','controlled-fleet',decodeFleetRegister],['diesel','stationary-diesel',decodeGeneratorRegister],['equipment','stationary-equipment',decodeStationaryRegister]] as const)result[family]=await decode(await get(root+'/'+base),company);result.fugitive=await decodeFugitiveRegister(await get(root+'/fugitive-sources'),company);return result};
 const verifyFugitiveReport=async(raw:any)=>{const r=await decodeFugitiveReport(raw,company),base=root+'/'+(r.family==='source'?'fugitive-sources':'fugitive-population')+'/'+r.streamId;check(same(r,await decodeFugitiveReport(await get(base+'/reports/'+r.id),company)));const s=parseM77Json(r.snapshotJson,10_000_000) as any;for(const v of [s.version,...(s.proof?.workpaperVersions??[])]){const exact=await decodeFugitiveVersion(await get(root+'/'+(v.family==='source'?'fugitive-sources':'fugitive-population')+'/'+v.streamId+'/versions/'+v.id),company);check(same(core(exact),core(v))&&(!v.review||same(exact.review,v.review)))}return r};
 const decodeOutcome=async(name:string,raw:any,route:string)=>{if(route.endsWith('/reports'))return verifyFugitiveReport(raw);if(route.endsWith('/reviews')){const v=await decodeFugitiveVersion(await get(route.replace(/\/reviews$/,'/versions/'+raw.versionId)),company);check(same(v.review,raw));return raw}return decodeFugitiveVersion(raw,company)};
